<title>MEXICO: Far-Ben to acquire 50 pct El Fenix.</title>
<headline>Far-Ben to acquire 50 pct El Fenix.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican pharamceutical retail chain Farmacias Benevides (Far-Ben) is to acquire a 50-percent stake in the El Fenix drugstore chain for undisclosed terms, the firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Benavides &quot;has signed a letter of intent on December 17 to form a strategic alliance with Drogueria y Farmacia El Fenix S.A. de C.V... Far-Ben Bevides plans to invest approximately 50 million pesos, acquiring a 50 participation in El Fenix,&quot; Far-Ben said.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey bureau, +528 345-7617))</p>
